      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3287_Start4" name="Annual plan; ecommerce growth (per profile §8.5)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3287_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3287_Task5" name="Merchandise Planner allocate the revenue/margin plan across channels: in-store…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandise Planner allocate the revenue/margin plan across channels: in-store (97.1%), ecommerce BOPIS+delivery (links to VS-10), marketplace presence (links to VS-65), and BuildRight-operated marketplace (links to VS-95); account for channel-specific cost (fulfillment fee per profile §2, last-mile per VS-06/VS-56, marketplace commission)
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner / Ecommerce
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3287_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3287_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3287_Task6" name="Category Managers set channel assortment/price strategy (which SKUs on which…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Category Managers set channel assortment/price strategy (which SKUs on which channel, channel price parity per VS-57, digital-catalog content per VS-01.3) and allocate receipt/OTB to support multi-channel demand (links to VS-60 order routing)
Responsible (R): Category Managers / Ecommerce
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3287_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3287_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3287_Task7" name="Merchandise Planner/FP&amp;A track channel contribution margin (revenue − COGS −…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Merchandise Planner/FP&amp;A track channel contribution margin (revenue − COGS − channel fulfillment cost), isolate channel profitability, and re-plan channel mix as ecommerce grows to 5–7% (links to VS-10)
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3287_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3287_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3287_End8" name="Complete">
