      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3288_Start5" name="Weekly merchandise review; in-season">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3288_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3288_Task6" name="Merchandise Planner compile weekly P&amp;A: actual vs plan for sales, GM%…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandise Planner compile weekly P&amp;A: actual vs plan for sales, GM%, receipts, markdowns, EOM stock, sell-through, and weeks-of-supply by department/category/key-item; flag variances beyond threshold
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3288_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3288_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3288_Task7" name="Category Managers/Merchandise Planner reforecast in-season: update season-end…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Category Managers/Merchandise Planner reforecast in-season: update season-end projection using actuals + remaining weeks; decide reorder/cancel/markdown actions against OTB (W3283/W3284) and markdown budget (W3285); coordinate supply response (links to VS-02.1)
Responsible (R): Category Managers / Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3288_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3288_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3288_Task8" name="VP Merchandising conduct weekly P&amp;A review with Buyers, Supply Planning, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: VP Merchandising conduct weekly P&amp;A review with Buyers, Supply Planning, and FP&amp;A; approve actions (chase, cancel, markdown, transfer per VS-05.2), update OTB and markdown budget, and report material variance to CFO/COO (links to VS-33.2)
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3288_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3288_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3288_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3288_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
